<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Oct current account surplus 6.9 bln SKR.</title>
<headline>Swedish Oct current account surplus 6.9 bln SKR.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's current account for October showed a surplus of 6.9 billion crowns for a surplus of 42.6 billion crowns in the September-October year, central bank (Riksbank) figures showed on Thursday.</p>
</text>
